 "pacing": {
  "note": "Each budget paces its spending inside the month. The day limit holds over the 24 hours before the event's moment and the week limit over the 7 days before it, so no boundary lets two days' spending through at once. Spent in a window is every settle written in it; every open reservation, of any age, is held against every limit. A budget without day_usd or week_usd gets them from its cap: a day is cap_usd times 3/30 and a week is cap_usd times 1.5/4, rounded down to the millionth. A reserve is allowed when it fits the month, the week and the day; refused, it names the first it does not fit, in that order: cap, cap-week, cap-day.",
